{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_001_title", "source_sha256": "cfbb7f458ef202cf572997203428c3a204b46be46268827f3ca0af7f6ca5c35b", "ja": "いちばん大事なこと", "zh": "最重要的事", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_001_synopsis", "source_sha256": "aed7fc6e24cd4b6919951e0203e99fd1b1b1469f46d326f697ca8a3a721d8b8c", "ja": "初センターに選ばれた未来。ウキウキ気分も\nつかの間、センターとして何をすればいいの\nかわからず戸惑ってしまう。だが春香やプロ\nデューサーの言葉をヒントに迷いを振り切り\nいざステージへ……！", "zh": "未来第一次被选为Center，然而兴奋期待\n只持续了片刻，她不知道Center该做什么，\n为此感到十分困惑。但春香和制作人的话点醒\n了她，让她挥别烦恼，顺利登上舞台……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_001_1000_p", "source_sha256": "59b425a4c9f753932a10a998d2a7e8eccf2d35215b91e82e3bf9d089e4123c8d", "ja": "未来！", "zh": "未来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_001_1001_014mir", "source_sha256": "4f641bf2ec0f00da543f58c614e61c90a7436725033eb750fba6e59f57e33b3a", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さんだ♪\nどうしたんですか？", "zh": "啊，是{$P$}先生♪\n找我有什么事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_001_1002_p", "source_sha256": "0dd242fe174773384d41f7e762f7ab81d0cf3f8cbff272b1a9055a15ee54f3d3", "ja": "ああ。実は今度、未来に\nセンターをやってもらおうと思ってるんだ。", "zh": "是啊。其实在下一次，\n我想让未来担任Center。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_001_1003_015siz", "source_sha256": "cf058c39e43979fcff2872870c54528357c89c5815221596e9d2c9906c1c2b4f", "ja": "えっ！？　未来が、センターに？", "zh": "咦！？未来当Center？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_001_1004_016tsu", "source_sha256": "fc0d390daa2810763e561145fa13b32b5545d6056ad7bf714836861c119ad769", "ja": "いいな～、未来。私もやりたいな～♪", "zh": "好羡慕喔～未来。我也好想当～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_001_1005_014mir", "source_sha256": "0e82abafa6710a8f29915e46a4ffac1172d00b467bf13dbc4a1d11a8fdf69bb2", "ja": "ねえねえ、静香ちゃん。\nセンターって？", "zh": "欸欸，小静。\n什么是Center？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_001_1006_015siz", "source_sha256": "3e30faa80de01e9852eb3ab74c01218d43a418628c8b693aac39ccead8429b15", "ja": "ええっ！？", "zh": "咦咦！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_001_1007_014mir", "source_sha256": "f3f98c37968312217540c8ecadbd9dda2888bd577ba146aa1a7279108cf41c3c", "ja": "あっ、わかった、ソフトボールのことだ！\n私、けっこう得意なんですよ♪", "zh": "啊，我知道了，是在讲垒球吧！\n那个我很厉害喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_001_1008_014mir", "source_sha256": "cdb93a6be37d4bf7eadc986dabcfbfd970a6545818c2eb122825f155e479f6aa", "ja": "でも{$P$}さん、どうして\n私がソフト得意なの、知ってたんですか？", "zh": "可是，{$P$}先生，\n你为什么会知道我很擅长垒球？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_001_1009_015siz", "source_sha256": "e44d265e00865ebc4aaab3e8a6cbb17ead1ea7638e5564dd1617fa1cf507f60b", "ja": "み、未来……。", "zh": "未、未来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_001_1010_016tsu", "source_sha256": "310e4b2d025f85d302021260066945d61fef5868115201751bb0a68e798a25dd", "ja": "あはは♪　未来ってば、やっぱ面白～い。", "zh": "啊哈哈♪未来果然很有趣～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_001_1011_014mir", "source_sha256": "71c5fc77bb030eb683e7b23a0e1f7d5ff4729d5092375049b22685e96203c537", "ja": "え、なんで？", "zh": "咦，为什么这么说？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_001_1012_p", "source_sha256": "db1444123bb9ce285d733e4cbe9cc67213702953b30c8af8d7253779550f361d", "ja": "ソフトボールの守備位置の話じゃないんだ。\nつまり……。", "zh": "我说的不是垒球的守备位置。\n我的意思是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_001_1013_p", "source_sha256": "f02f21c697a46bbe47874c73dadd9108b9811948a5e31f8e906df38def7092d8", "ja": "未来に劇場の公演で、みんなの真ん中に立って、\nメインを歌ってもらうことにした、ってことだよ。", "zh": "要让未来在剧场公演时，站在大家中间，\n负责当主唱。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_001_1014_014mir", "source_sha256": "b96cc87c143c4eddb7f9e5a75a363ab8809aa78a36bcce52827263fbe3f22940", "ja": "劇場の公演で……真ん中に立って？", "zh": "在剧场公演时……站在正中间？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_001_1015_014mir", "source_sha256": "79547f4a4ab6438f9430dfb42f64cb3e4994157323e07246a7390cf9fe262cd0", "ja": "えっ。……ええ～～～っ！？　わわ、私が！？\nそんな、真ん中って……目立っちゃいますよ！？", "zh": "咦……咦咦～～～！？我、我、我吗！？\n真的吗？站中间……会很醒目吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_001_1016_p", "source_sha256": "83c31ad0610474d9242ced23b9e19dfc36d7e45a99fc59a4dd72d096564497c7", "ja": "はは、目立ってくれないと困るけどな！\nとにかく、そういうことだ。", "zh": "哈哈，如果不醒目才头痛呢！\n总之，就是这么回事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_001_1017_p", "source_sha256": "d526f7fac73e56b105420cdb01779fbbf3c8ddf173761e1b841673e7d2fed40e", "ja": "公演当日まで、やることが山積みだぞ。\nしっかりな、未来。", "zh": "到公演当天为止，有很多事需要做准备。\n加油喔，未来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_001_1018_014mir", "source_sha256": "026c35facdec1ccfd51771b68774d07b35945f52d9ac70f678a4c22da79c649d", "ja": "は……はいっ！\nあの、あの。私……頑張りますっ！", "zh": "好……好的！\n那个、那个，我……会加油的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_001_1019_014mir", "source_sha256": "35a202d901b11e71d85b28e4d31b53e034cf0f98964f560e83eb25c8e965b16b", "ja": "センター……そっか、私が……。\nでへへ♪", "zh": "Center……吗？由我来当……\n嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_001_1020_p", "source_sha256": "e7e3b369f84d8a97b7b0aee3dc407f83d2c165d660dcf1fb5b8b63284babc0e9", "ja": "（未来を、センターに。\n……その新しい可能性に、賭けてみよう！）", "zh": "（让未来当Center……\n赌赌看新的可能性吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
